@{
    var resourcePath = "~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/zh-cn/Super/Styles/";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=0.7, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>Play For Fun</title>
    <link type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/Style/page.css")" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-desc">
            <span>会员网的<span class="bold">“免费试玩”</span>是允许客人在要求开启新产品之前以虚拟货币试玩。为了支持用户管理统计信息和产品申请，已创建了名为 “免费试玩”的新功能，它提供待处理要求的总计以及启用它们的快速方式。</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-images">
            <figure>
                <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f9.png")" alt="Fig 1">
                <figcaption>图1. “免费试玩” 仪表板</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-list">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-title">总代理免费试玩资料报告 </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">点击产品名称（或是点击在报告栏目的<span class="bold">免费试玩</span>资料）查看已尝试免费试玩的会员资料</div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f10.png")" alt="Fig 2">
                        <figcaption>图2. 在主页的免费试玩页面</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">免费试玩报表打开如下</div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f12.png")" alt="Fig 3">
                        <figcaption>图3. 总代理免费试玩资料报告</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">请注意，报告仅根据虚拟货币总结了会员所选产品的统计信息。点击帐户名称以获取下线的数据细节</div>

                <ul class="level-1">
                    <li><span class="bold">玩家人数</span>: 已尝试免费试玩产品的玩家人数</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">投注额</span>: 会员总投注额</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">会员输赢</span>: 会员总输赢</li>
                    <li><span class="bold">投注统计</span>: 总投注注单</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>